cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use SanityOps in research, in a product, or in internal AI Agent governance, please cite this specification."
title: "SanityOps Framework: AI Agent Continuous Governance Specification"
abstract: >-
  SanityOps is a vendor-neutral framework for the continuous governance of AI Agent logic
  artifacts (System Prompt, Skill, Tool Schema, and Permission). It defines static defect
  inspection, explicit and implicit risk auditing, and RAG-Agent / Tool-Agent quality
  evaluation, bound to artifact versions through a Baseline and Gate ratchet mechanism.
authors:
